#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in practical quantum computing, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji kemahiran anda dalam pengkomputeran kuantum secara praktikal, dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum computing in practice"
msgstr "Peperiksaan | Pengkomputeran kuantum secara praktikal"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan dan lencana {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Tinjauan selepas kursus {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Quantum computing in practice\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr "Tahniah kerana melengkapkan kursus \"Quantum computing in practice\" oleh IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Uji pengetahuan anda {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for Quantum computing in practice.\n"
msgstr "Selepas melengkapkan bacaan dan aktiviti dalam kursus ini, klik butang di bawah untuk menavigasi ke IBM Training, di mana anda boleh mengambil peperiksaan lencana untuk Quantum computing in practice.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Peperiksaan ini terdiri daripada 20 soalan, dan anda mesti menjawab sekurang-kurangnya 16 dengan betul untuk lulus. Setelah menerima markah lulus, lencana anda akan dihantar secara automatik ke e-mel yang anda gunakan untuk mendaftar dengan IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda bersedia untuk mengambil peperiksaan. Jika anda tidak menerima markah lulus dalam dua percubaan, peperiksaan akan dikunci buat sementara waktu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-computing-in-practice-DL46111G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "NOTIS: IBM memanfaatkan perkhidmatan Credly, iaitu pemproses data pihak ketiga yang dibenarkan oleh IBM dan terletak di Amerika Syarikat, untuk membantu dalam pentadbiran program IBM Digital Badge. Untuk mengeluarkan IBM Digital Badge kepada anda, maklumat peribadi anda (nama, alamat e-mel, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dikongsi dengan Credly. Anda akan menerima notifikasi e-mel daripada Credly dengan arahan untuk menuntut lencana tersebut. Maklumat peribadi anda digunakan untuk mengeluarkan lencana anda dan untuk tujuan pelaporan serta operasi program. IBM boleh berkongsi maklumat peribadi yang dikumpul dengan anak syarikat IBM dan pihak ketiga secara global. Ia akan diuruskan dengan cara yang konsisten dengan amalan privasi IBM. Penyata Privasi IBM boleh dilihat [di sini](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
